hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1083","(114) Woh hadd jisko pahunch kar ladka zurriyat ki hadd se nikal jata hai uska bab: 1121 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Atiyyah al-Qurazi se, unhon ne kaha: Banu Qurayzah wale din woh aadmi ki sharmgah ke baal dekhte the, phir agar baal nikal aaye hote to use qatl kar dete aur agar na nikle hote to use chhor dete, phir unhon ne mere baal dekhe to woh nahin nikle the, to unhon ne mujhe chhor diya."
